node1460 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>ownership</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;Ownership refers to the legal right to control, manage, and benefit from an asset, resource, or responsibility. It establishes authority, accountability, and entitlements over something, whether it&#x27;s property, a business, intellectual property, or responsibilities.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
